cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Localization-Quality Evaluation for Spatial Attribution (Section 4.4 reference implementation)"
abstract: >-
  Single-file C++17 reference implementation of Section 4.4 (localization-quality
  evaluation) of a dissertation on hybrid Bayesian tactical spatial identification
  of Wi-Fi signal sources: MAE/median/RMSE/MAD/trimmed mean, empirical CDF and
  P90/P95, zonal correctness, availability, HPD coverage and sharpness, zonal
  Brier and NLL, block-bootstrap confidence intervals and trajectory-aware
  aggregation.
type: software
authors:
